// A slur whose interior notes rise well above its endpoints must lift to clear
// them: the encompassed note-head columns are fed to the slur scorer as
// obstacles, so the curve is raised rather than cutting through the high g''/e''.
// LILYPOND-REF: lily/slur-scoring.cc score_encompass over the encompassed columns.
title "Slur obstacle clearance"
octave absolute
part m { clef treble }
section Main {
  m { c''4( g''4 e''4 c''4) | }
}
form main { Main }
score main "slur-obstacle-clearance" { staff m }
